# Thornback Ridge (CIPlay thornback_ridge): the six steps in order
island Thornback Ridge
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 2.5 -26.1 (RESIZE -6.1, DEEP -20 more); the points below are in the old frame
offset -2.5 26.1
expect step 0
expect title The Hermit
zone camp
expect step 1
read Hermit's journal
expect step 2
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 3
open Hermit's chest
wait 2
expect step 4
catch Chicken 1
expect step 5
zone tb_top
expect step 6
open Boat's seat locker
wait 3
expect story boathousekey 1
expect step 7
use boatlock
expect shown boatchest
read Hermit's boat log
expect step 8
read Hermit's map
expect done
